---
// src/components/PSEO.astro
---

<section class="reveal w-full py-[120px]" style="background-color: #0F1117; border-top: 1px solid #1A1A1A;">
    <div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-6">

        <div class="max-w-2xl mb-16">
            <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.15em] text-[#444444] uppercase mb-4">Built-in Growth</p>
            <h2 class="text-[clamp(32px,4vw,48px)] font-[800] text-[#FAFAFA] mb-5 tracking-tight leading-[1.05]">
                Programmatic SEO (pSEO) built right in.
            </h2>
            <p class="text-[17px] text-[#888888] leading-[1.7]">
                Most websites are just digital brochures. We build scalable engines. Our pSEO architecture automatically creates highly-targeted local pages to capture free Google traffic.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">

            <div class="pseo-card p-8 rounded-2xl bg-[#111111] border border-[#222222]" style="box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.04);">
                <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-[#1A1A1A] border border-[#2A2A2A] flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
                    <i data-lucide="layout-template" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#888888]"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-[700] text-[#FAFAFA] mb-3 tracking-tight">1. The Core Site</h3>
                <p class="text-[17px] text-[#888888] leading-[1.7]">
                    We build one ultra-fast, high-converting core website that serves as the foundation for your brand and primary ad traffic.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="pseo-card p-8 rounded-2xl bg-[#111111] border border-[#2563EB]/30 relative" style="box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.04), 0 0 0 1px rgba(37,99,235,0.1);">
                <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-[#2563EB]/10 border border-[#2563EB]/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
                    <i data-lucide="copy-check" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#2563EB]"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-[700] text-[#FAFAFA] mb-3 tracking-tight">2. Programmatic Expansion</h3>
                <p class="text-[17px] text-[#888888] leading-[1.7]">
                    We programmatically generate <strong class="text-[#FAFAFA] font-semibold">10 perfectly optimized local pages</strong> (e.g., "Plumber in PJ") targeting your specific areas.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="pseo-card p-8 rounded-2xl bg-[#111111] border border-[#222222]" style="box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.04);">
                <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-emerald-950/60 border border-emerald-900/40 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
                    <i data-lucide="magnet" class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-[700] text-[#FAFAFA] mb-3 tracking-tight">3. Long-Term Free Leads</h3>
                <p class="text-[17px] text-[#888888] leading-[1.7]">
                    Over time, Google indexes these local pages. You start capturing highly motivated, free organic search traffic locally.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .pseo-card {
        transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1),
                    border-color 0.2s ease,
                    background-color 0.2s ease;
    }
    .pseo-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-4px);
        background-color: #1A1A1A;
        border-color: #333333;
    }
</style>
